---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Prototype Drive Kit — Test Before You Commit"
  description="Order a complete BLDC drive prototype kit: motor, gearbox, brake, controller, encoder, wiring and documentation. Ready for integration testing in your equipment."
>
<section class="hero-inner">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Engineering → Prototype Drive Kit</p>
    <h1>Prototype Drive Kit</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Everything you need to test a complete BLDC drive system in your equipment — before committing to production volumes.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>What's Included</h2>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="kit-item"><span class="kit-icon">⚡</span><h3>BLDC Motor</h3><p>Selected for your payload and speed requirements. L-type or R-type geared, 15W–3kW range.</p></div>
      <div class="kit-item"><span class="kit-icon">⚙️</span><h3>Precision Gearbox</h3><p>Matched gear ratio for your wheel diameter and target speed. Alloy or titanium gears available.</p></div>
      <div class="kit-item"><span class="kit-icon">🔧</span><h3>Electromagnetic Brake</h3><p>24V spring-applied, power-off brake. Essential for sloped operation and parking safety.</p></div>
      <div class="kit-item"><span class="kit-icon">🎛️</span><h3>Matched Controller</h3><p>Pre-configured for the motor. Dual-channel available for differential steering applications.</p></div>
      <div class="kit-item"><span class="kit-icon">📡</span><h3>Encoder (Optional)</h3><p>1000 PPR incremental encoder for speed feedback, positioning, or closed-loop control.</p></div>
      <div class="kit-item"><span class="kit-icon">🔌</span><h3>Wiring & Documentation</h3><p>Complete wiring harness, connection diagram, parameter settings guide, and dimensional drawings.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="kit-note">
      <p><strong>Engineering Support Included:</strong> Our engineers assist with integration — motor mounting, controller parameter tuning, brake adjustment, and troubleshooting during your testing phase.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" style="background: var(--brand-surface);">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>How It Works</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><span class="step-num">1</span><h3>Submit Your Specs</h3><p>Fill out the <a href="/drive-selection/">Drive Selection form</a> with your payload, wheel size, speed and voltage.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><span class="step-num">2</span><h3>Receive Recommendation</h3><p>Our engineers respond within 24 hours with a matched drive configuration and kit quotation.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><span class="step-num">3</span><h3>Test in Your Equipment</h3><p>Integrate the prototype kit and validate performance. We support you remotely during testing.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><span class="step-num">4</span><h3>Adjust & Scale</h3><p>Fine-tune parameters if needed, then move to production orders with confidence.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section cta-section">
  <div class="container cta-inner">
    <h2>Request a Prototype Kit Quote</h2>
    <p>Tell us about your application and we'll configure the right kit for your testing.</p>
    <a href="/drive-selection/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get Started →</a>
  </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.hero-inner { background: var(--brand-dark); color: white; padding: 48px 0 56px; }
.breadcrumb { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); margin-bottom: 16px; }
.breadcrumb a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); text-decoration: none; }
.hero-inner h1 { font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.hero-sub { font-size: 17px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); max-width: 600px; }
.kit-item { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--brand-border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 28px; }
.kit-icon { font-size: 28px; display: block; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.kit-item h3 { font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.kit-item p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--brand-text-light); line-height: 1.5; }
.kit-note { margin-top: 32px; background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px 24px; }
.kit-note p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
.steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
.step { text-align: center; }
.step-num { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--brand-accent); color: white; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.step h3 { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.step p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--brand-text-light); }
.step a { color: var(--brand-accent); }
.cta-section { background: var(--brand-primary); color: white; text-align: center; }
.cta-inner h2 { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.cta-inner p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin-bottom: 28px; }
.btn-lg { padding: 16px 32px; font-size: 16px; }
@media (max-width: 768px) { .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
</style>
